		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Formattage des functions]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=27531#p27531"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Vous avez raison. Le query </p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>SELECT a.rolname AS &quot;owner&quot;,
  n.nspname AS &quot;schema&quot;,
  p.proname AS &quot;name&quot;,
  pg_get_functiondef(p.oid) AS &quot;definition&quot;
FROM pg_language AS l
JOIN pg_proc AS p
ON p.prolang = l.oid
JOIN pg_namespace AS n
ON p.pronamespace = n.oid
JOIN pg_authid AS a
ON a.oid = p.proowner
WHERE l.lanname = &#039;plpgsql&#039;
ORDER BY &quot;schema&quot; ASC,
  &quot;name&quot; ASC</code></pre></div><p>m&#039;a donné les informations nécessaires.<br />Merci à vous</p>]]></content>
